{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to WISHLIST and FOLLOW for updates!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lazy Train Game</i></strong> is a relaxing game about building out your railway, collecting resources, crafting tracks, overcoming obstacles, and unlocking new tracks, scenarios, and engines. Set up your railway in such a way that your trains can do most of the work for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/af39448c43f66292d699ce8c965ea7a5.poster.avif?t=1773947147\" width=1170 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/af39448c43f66292d699ce8c965ea7a5.webm?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/af39448c43f66292d699ce8c965ea7a5.mp4?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obstacles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through scenarios that have obstacles where you need to place certain tracks to overcome them. Some tracks are locked and must be collected before they can be crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/2c1eb801bd565047005c1a520c26664a.poster.avif?t=1773947147\" width=964 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/2c1eb801bd565047005c1a520c26664a.webm?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/2c1eb801bd565047005c1a520c26664a.mp4?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fabricators</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place fabricators and storage units together, and sometimes chain them together, in order to produce different resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/88f214271c8cdd3d0b0b29a8c672a97b.poster.avif?t=1773947147\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/88f214271c8cdd3d0b0b29a8c672a97b.webm?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/88f214271c8cdd3d0b0b29a8c672a97b.mp4?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new engines that give you different advantages such as additional speed or transport storage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/c3d8ccf875d51a1c7738cedb3ed60c52.poster.avif?t=1773947147\" width=1170 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/c3d8ccf875d51a1c7738cedb3ed60c52.webm?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/c3d8ccf875d51a1c7738cedb3ed60c52.mp4?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade various attributes to increase your storage sizes, collection rates, train car storage, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/71c3222d2eb6c26886dc1a283513e1ab.poster.avif?t=1773947147\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/71c3222d2eb6c26886dc1a283513e1ab.webm?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/extras/71c3222d2eb6c26886dc1a283513e1ab.mp4?t=1773947147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall asleep at your desk in the late hours of the night and when you wake up you will have collected resources and energy points to help you more easily progress through the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Again, don't forget to WISHLIST and FOLLOW for updates!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470220?t=1773947147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470220?t=1773947147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/001a8eee9b357e33b0a02a6447495b08707922a3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773947147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470220/001a8eee9b357e33b0a02a6447495b08707922a3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773947147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3655470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't forget to WISHLIST and FOLLOW for updates!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Lazy Train Game</i></strong> is a relaxing game about building out your railway, collecting resources, crafting tracks, overcoming obstacles, and unlocking new tr